      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test file with better understandability: split into focused test methods grouped by CharSet pattern, add `@DisplayName` annotations, extract shared setup to `@BeforeEach`, and remove unused imports.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version splits the original monolithic test into four focused methods (`testEquals_notEqualToNull`, `testEquals_individualCharSet`, `testEquals_rangeCharSet`, `testEquals_negatedRangeCharSet`), extracts shared setup into `@BeforeEach`, adds `@DisplayName` annotations for clarity, and removes all unused imports — preserving every original assertion with identical arguments and expected outcomes."
